This project focuses on analyzing Nykaa’s marketing campaign dataset using Excel to derive business insights related to campaign performance, customer targeting, ROI, conversions, engagement, and acquisition efficiency.

Key Highlights
- Performed campaign performance analysis using Excel formulas and Pivot Tables
- Built an interactive management dashboard for business insights
- Analyzed ROI, conversions, engagement score, acquisition cost, and customer segments
- Identified top-performing campaign types and channel combinations
- Evaluated language-wise and segment-wise campaign effectiveness

Skills Used
- Microsoft Excel
- Pivot Tables
- VLOOKUP
- COUNTIF / COUNTIFS
- Logical Functions
- Text Functions
- Dashboarding
- Marketing Analytics
- Business Analysis

Key Insights
- Hindi campaigns showed the highest ROI
- Social Media campaigns generated the highest revenue and conversions
- Influencer campaigns achieved the highest engagement scores
- Identified the most frequent high-performing channel combinations

